// A household: one person's money for the first quarter of 2026.
//
// This file marks the root of the project. Every `.ax` file below it is loaded,
// and its folders say what may be in it: `journal/2026/02.ax` holds February
// 2026 and nothing else, and `prices/` holds only prices.

base USD

use std
use us/401k
use us/529

/// Me: a designer at Acme, single, renting in San Francisco. Living here puts me
/// under the laws of San Francisco, California and the United States, and
/// `born` and `filing` are what those laws read.
entity me : person
  born   1988-04-12
  filing single
  lives  us/ca/san-francisco
